   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **soulive2011-05-18-d1t09** (1 review): Track 9 is titled El Ron [2]\n- **soulive2011-05-18-d1t11** (1 review): Track 11 is Tuesday Night Squad, part one [2]\n- **soulive2011-05-18-d1t12** (1 review): Track 12 is Tuesday Night Squad, part two [2]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Something in the Way**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n- **Elanor Rigby**: rare: 6 archived performances [3]\n- **soulive2011-05-18-d1t09**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Vapor**: back after 39 archived shows (746 days) [3]\n- **soulive2011-05-18-d1t11**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **soulive2011-05-18-d1t12**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **soulive2011-05-18.soulive2011-05-18-MK41** (recommended): source not stated; 12 songs; 83 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **soulive2011-05-18.soulive2011-05-18-MK41**: taped by Ron Harpin; transferred by RH; source: Schoeps MK41 > CMR > Naiant LB(Jensen)> Sony m10 [1]. Also: Recorded with Schoeps MK41 microphones through a CMR, a Naiant preamp with Jensen transformers, and a Sony M10 recorder; Transfer went from USB into Audition 3.0, then CD Wave, then Traders Little Helper [1]",
